{"version":1,"content":"<p>已故樂壇殿堂級男歌手羅文於2002年病逝，今日（10月18日）正值其離世24周年的日子。</p><p>後輩蔡一傑特意於社交平台上載羅文昔日專輯《朋友一個》的封套照片，以此表達對一代巨星的深切懷念。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T07:18:47.081896+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T06:24:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T22:29:00.493101+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T07:17:31.821291+00:00","content_hash":"58094d5b27298d2a6de3832546c88983b910fbe7ae009d004da1198c49526219","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}